{"id":"lele-49","title":"202103 青少年软件编程等级考试Scratch一级模拟题","subject":"scratch","subjectName":"电子学会Scratch","level":1,"yearmonth":"202103","year":"2021","count":37,"questions":[{"no":1,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"下面对中心点的描述正确的是（）？"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：中心点不能设置在角色之外"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：角色围绕中心点旋转"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：不能修改角色的中心点位置"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：其他三项都正确"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":2,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"在对背景进行修改编辑的过程中，去除我们不需要的部分，需要使用绘图中的（）工具？"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：画笔"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：选择工具"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：橡皮擦"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：填充工具"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":3,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"点击绿旗，下面哪个程序可以让小猫转向左边"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221024/16665807168907.png"},{"t":"?"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221024/16665819051423.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221024/16665819149414.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221024/16665819233971.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221024/16665824056277.png"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":4,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"下列关于舞台的描述，不正确的是？"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：舞台可以有很多背景"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：舞台背景可以切换"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：舞台中背景可以移动"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：可以把角色当背景来用"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"在Scratch编程中，舞台（Stage）是展示角色和背景的区域。让我们逐一分析每个选项： A：舞台可以有很多背景 这是正确的。Scratch允许用户为舞台添加多个背景，并在程序中切换这些背景。 B：舞台背景可以切换 这也是正确的。通过编写脚本，可以在不同背景之间进行切换，例如使用“切换背景”或“下一个背景”等积木。 C：舞台中背景可以移动 这是不正确的。在Scratch中，背景本身是不能直接移动的。虽然可以通过角色或克隆来模拟背景的移动（例如，让一个角色作为背景的一部分并移动它），但背景本身作为一个整体是不可移动的。 D：可以把角色当背景来用 这是正确的。用户可以将角色设计得与背景相似，或者通过脚本控制角色的行为，使其看起来像是背景的一部分。 因此，不正确的描述是选项C。","auto":true},{"no":5,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"执行下列哪一个积木指令后，舞台上的小猫角色就会隐藏？"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221024/16665831536883.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221024/16665831654560.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221024/16665831778171.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221024/16665831897411.png"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":6,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"舞台有三个背景，背景的程序如下图："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221024/16665905878621.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221024/16665905993106.png"},{"t":"小猫执行下面的程序，小猫说的内容是？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221024/16665906727423.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：1"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：2"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：3"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：1、2、3都可能"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":7,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"我们对角色A进行编程，完成了正确的代码后，执行发现A没有任何的反应，而角色B却按照A的代码执行起来，最可能的原因是？"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：图形化软件出了差错"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：将角色A的代码写给了角色B"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：计算机出现了运行问题"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：其他三项都不是"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":8,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"执行哪一段程序后，小猫可以从舞台的A位置，沿着B、C点到达D位置？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221024/16665914756269.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221128/16696314887789.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221024/16665915665599.png"}