左扇动翅膀飞行。"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221024/16665959831927.png"}],"options":[],"answer":null,"analysis":"","auto":false},{"no":2,"type":"问答题","stem":[{"t":"舞者凯希"},{"t":"1.准备工作"},{"t":"(1)从素材库上传背景：舞台1、舞台2;"},{"t":"(2)删除小猫角色，添加Cassy Dance角色，并添加声音dance magic。"},{"t":"2.功能实现"},{"t":"(1)Cassy Dance面向右侧，初始造型为【Cassy Dance-a】，初始坐标为【7,50】,并说“Let’s dance!!”2秒;"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221110/16680510464479.png"},{"t":"(2)2秒后，播放声音【dance magic】;"},{"t":"(3)开始跳舞：Cassy Dance每隔1秒切换一次造型;"},{"t":"(4)Cassy Dance每切换一次造型，都要旋转15度，方向依次为右-左-左-右;"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221110/16680511292258.png"},{"t":"(5)在Cassy Dance开始跳舞前，背景要换成【舞台1】;"},{"t":"(6)当Cassy Dance开始舞蹈的后，背景要在【舞台2】和【舞台1】之间来回切换，一共切换8次，每次等待1秒;"},{"t":"(7)每次舞台切换时，舞台的【颜色】增加3。"}],"options":[],"answer":null,"analysis":"","auto":false}],"durationMin":60,"totalScore":100,"passScore":60,"source":"leledati","tags":{"year":"2021","type":"模拟","progress":"未开始"}}